= Toribio Echevarría

Echevarría is a self-taught worker-intellectual from the arms-making town of Eibar, a <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span> figure who bridges the party to the observant Catholic workers of the Basque country and the industrial north - proof that a socialist need not be an enemy of the faithful.

- @democratic_rally
- @catholics_rally
- @support_peoples_party
